---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy for Assamese Manuscript Archive and Samaguri Satra digital preservation platform. Learn how visitor and researcher data is protected."
  keywords="privacy policy, data protection, Assamese Manuscript Archive, Samaguri Satra, user privacy, digital archive privacy"
>
  <div class="py-28 px-4 sm:px-8 md:px-24 lg:px-40 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-12 text-center">
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl text-ink font-medium mb-4">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-body text-sm text-muted">
        Last Updated: September 30, 2026
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-body leading-relaxed bg-[var(--color-bg-elevated)] p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-2xl border border-[var(--color-hairline)] shadow-sm">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink font-semibold mb-3">1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>
          The <strong>Assamese Manuscript Archive</strong> (a collaborative initiative between Girijananda Chowdhury University, Assam, and Samaguri Satra, Majuli, supported by ASTEC) is committed to protecting the privacy of visitors, scholars, and researchers who access our digital archive, exhibits, and audio guides.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink font-semibold mb-3">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p class="mb-2">We collect only necessary information to facilitate user engagement, scholarly inquiry, and visitor assistance:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
          <li><strong>Contact & Visit Inquiries:</strong> When you submit a message or plan a visit, we receive your name, email address, phone number, and query details.</li>
          <li><strong>Visitor Feedback:</strong> Ratings, comments, and suggestions provided through our feedback forms.</li>
          <li><strong>Technical & Analytical Data:</strong> Anonymized browser information, device type, and page access patterns to optimize user experience and accessibility.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink font-semibold mb-3">3. How Information is Used</h2>
        <p>Information collected is strictly utilized for:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
          <li>Responding to scholar queries, visitor bookings, and guided tour requests.</li>
          <li>Improving digital preservation displays and multilingual audio guide delivery.</li>
          <li>Academic project reporting and technological evaluation under the ASTEC ITGA grant scheme.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-2">We do not sell, rent, or commercialize your personal information to third parties.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink font-semibold mb-3">4. Cookies and Local Storage</h2>
        <p>
          Our platform uses lightweight local storage solely to retain your user preferences (such as light/dark mode selection and audio guide language preferences). We do not deploy invasive third-party tracking cookies or advertising pixels.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink font-semibold mb-3">5. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>
          For questions regarding this privacy policy or your personal data, please contact:
        </p>
        <div class="mt-3 p-4 bg-[var(--color-surface-soft)] rounded-lg text-sm">
          <p><strong>Project Coordination Office:</strong> Assamese Manuscript Archive</p>
          <p>Girijananda Chowdhury University &amp; Samaguri Satra, Majuli, Assam, India</p>
          <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:info@assammanuscriptarchive.com" class="text-[var(--color-primary)] hover:underline">info@assammanuscriptarchive.com</a></p>
          <p><strong>Phone:</strong> +91 98765 43210</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
